pointless or whatever,

01:57:33.762 --> 01:57:34.980
I'm just gonna fuckin' take it.

01:57:34.980 --> 01:57:35.813
- Yeah, I mean.

01:57:35.813 --> 01:57:38.110
I let "League of Legends"
ruin my life so I'm just,

01:57:38.110 --> 01:57:42.040
I put far too many hours
into "League of Legends"

01:57:42.040 --> 01:57:44.039
